## Summary
The article discusses how OTT platforms are implementing 'original broadcast protection' strategies to retain viewers who initially tune in for baseball content. It highlights the competitive tactics used by streaming services to engage and maintain audiences.

## Key Points
- OTT services are leveraging baseball content to attract and retain viewers.
- Strategies like 'original broadcast protection' are being introduced to prevent viewer drop-off.
- This reflects growing competition in the streaming industry to secure subscriber loyalty.


